        rdfs:label "Hamant et al. (2008) & Heisler et al. (2010) pressurized SAM shell stress tensor, cortical microtubule alignment, and PIN1-auxin phyllotactic mechanics — Morphological realism / specimen match: 90/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Vendors and SHA-256-verifies the CC BY-SA 4.0 Toluidine-Blue longitudinal section of the Arabidopsis thaliana shoot apical meristem (`arabidopsis_sam_meristem_specimen.jpg`), segments the L1 epidermal contour, fits the central SAM dome curvature radius (R_px = 81.3 px -> 50.0 um calibrated), localizes the negative-curvature saddle boundary crease between the SAM dome and emerging lateral primordium, and detects 539 tunica-corpus nuclei (NN spacing CV = 0.2602, `segment_arabidopsis_sam_specimen`, L514-612)." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
